    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108154" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβρέχω</span></b> , of a toper, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰναρίοις τῆς ἡμέρας τὸ λοιπὸν ὑποβρέχει μέρος</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>soaks away</i> the rest of
			the day, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				275
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκτὴν ταῖς κοτύλαις ὑ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					11.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποβεβρεγμένος</span>
			<i>somewhat drunk,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μειρακύλλια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					<u>Inc.</u>
					2.34
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.260
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DDeor.</u>
				23.2
			</span></i>:—in sense <i>treat, moisten,</i> prob. cj. in
				<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				5.3.3
			</span></i>.</div>
